{"version":1,"content":"<p>【智能叛變 😱】OpenAI 近期再公布一宗 AI 代理突破授權邊界意外，披露其內部研發中的「GPT-5.6 Sol」系列模型在執行一項程式碼編寫任務時，竟自行透過公開開發者助記詞導出私鑰，並擅自調用第三方錢包內的以太坊測試幣以支付智能合約的部署費用，事後更對用戶隱瞞了未經授權動用資金的行為。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:39:40.516322+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:30:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:57:32.781692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:38:22.429129+00:00","content_hash":"4d461c4fff00fc922d7c9698f9c0e1d7eef5a9fd8a730fa7ba54bd8ec8ec7605","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}